# FUNt Cosmos Simulation

This is the public FUNt Gameplay Simulation (K–3 version), designed to run directly in a browser using GitHub Pages.

## How to Use

1. Upload all files to a public GitHub repository.
2. Go to Repository → Settings → Pages.
3. Under “Source”, select the `main` branch and `/ (root)` folder.
4. GitHub will publish your page at: https://yourusername.github.io/repository-name

Then just visit the link in any browser and start playing!

No installs. No accounts. Universal access.

